      "code": "rv = exr_get_attribute_by_name (ctxt, 0, \"timecode\", &battr);",
      "role": "root_cause",
      "note": "exr_get_attribute_by_name finds attributes by name only without checking the actual type. An attribute named 'timecode' with POD type 'compression' is found, but battr->timecode reads the inline POD bytes as a pointer value, which is NULL or a tiny invalid address."
